While this file exists, Vercel skips building pushes to this repository (see "ignoreCommand" in
vercel.json), so unfinished work can be pushed without changing the live website.
Delete this file in the commit that should go live.

Held now: some demo websites under src/app/(demos)/demos/ are still being built and do not
compile yet. They are not listed in LIVE (src/demos/catalog.ts), so they are not shown anywhere.
